    <item>
      <title>蓝白足矣</title>
      <link>https://gazerrr03.github.io/readME/writing/blue-and-white-are-enough/?lang=zh-CN</link>
      <guid isPermaLink="true">https://gazerrr03.github.io/readME/writing/blue-and-white-are-enough/</guid>
      <pubDate>Sat, 12 Jul 2025 00:00:00 GMT</pubDate>
      <description>两种颜色不是限制，而是一种压缩算法。界面的每一种状态都必须能被描述成&quot;墨&quot;或&quot;纸&quot;，于是任何含糊的东西都活不到屏幕上。</description>
