    <item>
      <title>抖动做决定</title>
      <link>https://gazerrr03.github.io/readME/writing/the-dither-decides/?lang=zh-CN</link>
      <guid isPermaLink="true">https://gazerrr03.github.io/readME/writing/the-dither-decides/</guid>
      <pubDate>Sun, 09 Mar 2025 00:00:00 GMT</pubDate>
      <description>两种颜色之间没有第三种。渐变想在这块屏幕上活下来，就得交给抖动处理，而抖动不做调和，它投票：每个像素都要站起来声明自己是墨还是纸。</description>
